    "termsOfAccess": "Per 11 februari 2016 is deze dataset beschikbaar als Open Access for registered users. De deponeerder, J. Dronkers, wenst op de hoogte gehouden te worden van eventuele publicaties en onderzoeken op basis van deze data. Contactgegevens staan op http://apps.eui.eu/Personal/Dronkers/\n\nAs of February 11th, 2016, this dataset is available as an Open Access for registered users dataset. The depositor, J. Dronkers, would like to hear of any publication and/or research based on these data. His contact details are on http://apps.eui.eu/Personal/Dronkers/",
